WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.320
The streets are begging for help, and Trump's the president for all Americans, even in Portland.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.920
Yesterday morning, I was broken again for the 10th time.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.400
We need help here, and something needs to be done, so if this is what we need to do

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.040
to get our leaders paying attention to what's happening in Portland, then I think it's a

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.040
good thing.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.320
A business is burglarized 10 times, and Portland politicians don't want to help?

